chy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
