      "problem": "$|\\begin{aligned}-4 & 0 & -3 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -4 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 6 & 5 & -3 \\\\ 8 & -9 & 6 & 7\\end{aligned}|=$",
      "worked_solution": "Using a cofactor expansion along the $4$th column, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}-4 & 0 & -3 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -4 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 6 & 5 & -3 \\\\ 8 & -9 & 6 & 7\\end{aligned}| & =0\\cdot {C}_{14}+0\\cdot {C}_{24}+(-3)\\cdot {C}_{34}+7\\cdot {C}_{44} \\\\  & =(-3)\\cdot (-1)^{3+4}|\\begin{aligned}-4 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -4 \\\\ 8 & -9 & 6\\end{aligned}|+7\\cdot (-1)^{4+4}\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}-4 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -4 \\\\ 4 & 6 & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}-4 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -4 \\\\ 8 & -9 & 6\\end{aligned}|+7\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}-4 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -4 \\\\ 4 & 6 & 5\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
